      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, allows for more freedom in world where scrict sizes aren't needed while also allowing game worlds to say set a min-max height. Just fleshes out the feature more, and allows for more creativity. (I.e Kaiju games, toying with worlds as people are on them as if it's a miniature, etc.)\n\nAlso the limits feel pretty arbitrary",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
