      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love to see the scaling limit go lower than 0.2m! That's still a whopping 7.8 inches tall!\n\nAt the moment I can get to 0.02m, with the \"forced\" near clipping option on and still can access my menu.\n\nMake it so the forced near-clip automatically gets turned on if the game detects the player getting small enough where it might be an issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "64bd7187abee430958dfa43c",
      "author": {
        "_id": "62def689930a3044b6fffc15",
        "alias": "Olive Planarian",
        "aliasID": "65c69bf5ed6eefce4cc701ff",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/209bd3c3d1dc4cedd2a0e4269b0a4cce.png",
        "created": "2022-07-25T20:01:13.961Z",
        "name": "Raeal",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": "<redacted>"
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2023-07-23T18:29:27.685Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "64952b33f08694092225b847",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I get that they have a majority Quest player population, but this really feels like forced Quest compatibility. If I'm primarily a PCVR player, why do I need to limit myself to Quest performance if me and my friends all have computers that can push better performance and interactions?\n\nI would love to see this limit be set up in a way that makes it so anything outside of the .2m - 5m range would make it incompatible for Quest; but still usable and playable on PCVR. It would at least be a step in the right direction in terms of implementation.\n\nTLDR: Sure, make it a limit for quest and mobile compatibility; but don't restrict EVERYONE for one platform. This feels like a blanket \"fix\" for something that wasn't broken. ESPECIALLY when other platforms have implemented scaling already",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
