      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Keeping the default between 0.2m to 5.0m makes sense because any bigger than that can be obnoxious in worlds not designed for it, but world authors should be allowed to uncap scaling completely imo (or at least like 0.001m to 1,000m)",
